(156,'bmQ9d','chat',457,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4em4g1cclij","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 🚗 We have 4 fantastic cars available at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli. Here''s what we''ve got:nn- Toyota Glanza, 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-glanza/nn- Maruti Suzuki Fronx (Manual), 5 seats, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx-2/nn- Maruti Suzuki Fronx (Automatic), 5 seats, Petrol, ₹150/hr or ₹3600/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx/nn- Maruti Suzuki Baleno, 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-baleno/nnAll are 5-seaters, perfect for small groups or families. What kind of trip are you planning — a short getaway or longer rental?nnMay I also have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 08:07:51","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
