(159,'bmQ9d','chat',462,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"95O9497566\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for sharing that number! 😊 Just to confirm — is that your mobile number? And may I have your name as well so our team can assist you better?nnIn the meantime, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and what dates are you looking at?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:11:11","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(160,'bmQ9d','chat',463,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"95O9497566\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for sharing that number! 😊 Just to confirm — is that your mobile number? And may I have your name as well so our team can assist you better?nnIn the meantime, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and what dates are you looking at?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ha\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ha! 😄 So, tell me — are you looking to rent a car for a trip? How many people will be traveling, and do you have dates in mind?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:11:52","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(161,'bmQ9d','chat',464,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_u0kri4vpjf","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"We don''t have a 7-seater in our current fleet. All our cars are 5-seaters. nnWould a 5-seater work for you, or are you looking for something specifically to fit a larger group? If you let me know how many people you''re planning to travel with and your budget, I can suggest the best option! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 18:42:52","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
