(171,'bmQ9d','chat',568,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_8vywg8e2a8","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Affordable car for a day\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Great choice. For a day trip, I''d recommend these affordable options:nn**Toyota Glanza** - ₹2,808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-glanza/nn**Maruti Suzuki Fronx (Manual)** - ₹2,808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx-2/nn**Maruti Suzuki Baleno** - ₹2,808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-baleno/nnAll three are 5-seater, fuel-efficient, and perfect for a day out. Which one interests you? And may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you with the best offers?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-13 23:00:12","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(172,'bmQ9d','chat',605,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_02lxlu12enfn","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** – You tell me what you need (trip type, how many people, dates), and I''ll suggest the best cars with prices.nn2. **Get a quote** – I''ll show you the exact price for your rental period.nn3. **Confirm & book** – Once you''re happy, I''ll create your booking. It''s \\\\\\"pending payment\\\\\\" at this stage.nn4. **Pay & verify on our website** – You''ll go to our website to pay the booking amount and complete a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar).nn5. **Pick up your car** – You''re all set! Come to our location in Ghansoli and drive away.nn**Important:** Minimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and your booking amount is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-14 06:11:03","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(173,'bmQ9d','chat',631,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_51tkpnxrd3g","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Before I show you our cars, quick question — are you looking for a **small car for 1-2 people**, a **family car for 5 people**, or something **larger like an SUV**? That''ll help me suggest the best fit for you.nnIn the meantime, here''s our full fleet:nn- Toyota Glanza - ₹2,808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-glanza/n- Maruti Suzuki Fronx - ₹3,600/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx/n- Maruti Suzuki Baleno - ₹2,808/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-baleno/n- Mahindra XUV500 - ₹4,488/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv500/nnWhat''s your trip looking like? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-14 10:42:03","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(174,'bmQ9d','chat',632,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_47pqdbfzvei","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have some great options in Navi Mumbai.nnQuick question — how many people are you planning to travel with, and roughly how many days do you need the car?nnThat way I can suggest the perfect fit for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-14 10:42:22","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
