(244,'bmQ9d','chat',853,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_l9vszpw6ya","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Who will deliver and pickup the car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! 🚗nnCar Rent Pe is a **self-drive rental service**, so you pick up and drop off the car yourself at our location in **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli** (Navi Mumbai). There''s no driver delivery — you drive the car yourself.nnIf you need a driver for your trip, we can arrange that as an add-on option at the time of booking.nnWhat dates were you looking to rent a car?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-20 12:42:16","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(245,'bmQ9d','chat',854,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_l9vszpw6ya","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Who will deliver and pickup the car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! 🚗nnCar Rent Pe is a **self-drive rental service**, so you pick up and drop off the car yourself at our location in **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli** (Navi Mumbai). There''s no driver delivery — you drive the car yourself.nnIf you need a driver for your trip, we can arrange that as an add-on option at the time of booking.nnWhat dates were you looking to rent a car?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Is there no other central location of yiurs at western express highway\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Good question! Based on our current fleet, all our cars are located at **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli**. We don''t have a location on Western Express Highway at the moment.nnHowever, if that works for you, Ghansoli is reasonably accessible. For any special requests or to check if there are other options, I''d recommend reaching out to our team at the Contact page: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnWhen are you planning to rent? I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-20 12:44:32","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(246,'bmQ9d','chat',855,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_l9vszpw6ya","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Who will deliver and pickup the car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! 🚗nnCar Rent Pe is a **self-drive rental service**, so you pick up and drop off the car yourself at our location in **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli** (Navi Mumbai). There''s no driver delivery — you drive the car yourself.nnIf you need a driver for your trip, we can arrange that as an add-on option at the time of booking.nnWhat dates were you looking to rent a car?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Is there no other central location of yiurs at western express highway\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Good question! Based on our current fleet, all our cars are located at **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli**. We don''t have a location on Western Express Highway at the moment.nnHowever, if that works for you, Ghansoli is reasonably accessible. For any special requests or to check if there are other options, I''d recommend reaching out to our team at the Contact page: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnWhen are you planning to rent? I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Tmrw evening until dayafter noon\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! So you need the car from tomorrow evening until the day after at noon — that''s roughly 20 hours.nnHow many people will be traveling? And do you have a budget in mind, or a preference (compact, spacious, automatic, etc.)? That''ll help me suggest the best cars for you! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-20 12:45:08","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
