(284,'bmQ9d','chat',909,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_xznhnf0zatr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want one car for my daily commute to my job\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! I''d love to help you find the perfect car for your daily commute. 🚗nnA couple of quick questions to narrow it down:n- How many people will usually be in the car (just you, or do you carpool)?n- What''s your budget range per day or per month?nnThis''ll help me suggest the best fit for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-21 13:09:03","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(285,'bmQ9d','chat',910,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_xznhnf0zatr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want one car for my daily commute to my job\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! I''d love to help you find the perfect car for your daily commute. 🚗nnA couple of quick questions to narrow it down:n- How many people will usually be in the car (just you, or do you carpool)?n- What''s your budget range per day or per month?nnThis''ll help me suggest the best fit for you!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Just me\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! For solo commuting, I''d recommend a fuel-efficient, compact car. Here are my top picks:nn- Maruti Suzuki WagonR - ₹2,300/day, ₹96/hr. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-wagonr/n- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day, ₹104/hr. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-swift/n- Tata Altroz - ₹2,500/day, ₹104/hr (Petrol + CNG). Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/tata-altroz-2/nnThe WagonR is the most budget-friendly, while the Swift and Altroz offer great space and efficiency. All are perfect for daily commuting!nnHow often would you need the car — every day, or just certain days? That''ll help me clarify the best pricing for you. 😊nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you better and share the best offers?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-21 13:09:19","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
