(340,'bmQ9d','chat',1017,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_disczwwzf4a","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want to list my car and check eligibility\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for your interest! 🚗nnI think there might be a small mix-up — Car Rent Pe is a car *rental* service where you can book and drive cars. We''re not a platform for listing your own car.nnIf you''d like to **rent a car** for a trip, I''m here to help you find the perfect one! Or if you have other questions, please reach out to our team at https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnWhat can I help you with today?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-25 18:53:57","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
