(407,'bmQ9d','chat',1120,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_40e2p4jsgl5","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** – Browse our fleet, choose what suits you, and tell us when you need it.nn2. **Get a quote** – We''ll show you the price for your rental period.nn3. **Confirm & book** – Once you''re happy, give us your name and phone number, and we''ll create your booking.nn4. **Pay on the website** – Your booking is \\\\\\"pending payment\\\\\\" until you complete payment and quick KYC (driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar) on our website.nn5. **Pick up your car** – Come to Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli, and drive away!nnMinimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and the advance/booking amount is non-refundable.nnWant to book a car? What kind of trip are you planning? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-30 09:32:13","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
