(426,'bmQ9d','chat',1141,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_2igcjgn0b3u","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want t-pertmit for commercial\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for reaching out! 🚗nnI think there might be a small mix-up — Car Rent Pe is a **self-drive car rental service**, not a permit or licensing service. We rent cars by the day or hour for personal and business trips.nnIf you''re looking to **rent a car for commercial use** (like deliveries, client meetings, or business travel), we''d be happy to help! We have sedans, SUVs, and bigger vans available.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning, and how many people or how much space do you need?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-31 10:26:33","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
