(440,'bmQ9d','chat',1157,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_gf4h9so5tm","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ji mai karna tahata hu  9506400958\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 🙏 Shukriya aapka number share karne ke liye. nnAap kaun sa car book karna chahte ho? Aur kab tak ki zaroorat hai? Mujhe bataao:n- Kitne log travel karenge?n- Budget kya hai?n- Kaunsa date pickup aur kaunsa date return?nnPhir main aapko best options suggest kar dunga!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Koi sa bhi kar ho\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Theek hai! Phir mujhe kuch details chahiye:nn1. **Kitne log travel karenge** — 2-3, ya 5-6, ya 7 log?n2. **Kab pickup aur kab return** — dates aur time bataao (jaise 15 January, 10 AM se 17 January, 6 PM).nnInhi se main aapke liye perfect car suggest kar dunga! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 09:33:13","_zc_chat_turns":"4","_zc_chat_contact":"9506400958","_zc_chat_phone":"9506400958","_zc_chat_is_lead":"1","_zc_chat_summary_sent":"1","_zc_chat_summary_link":"https://wa.me/918291588796?text=CAR%20RENT%20PE%20%E2%80%94%20WEBSITE%20CHAT%20ENQUIRY%0AName%3A%20Not%20given%0APhone%3A%209506400958%0ATime%3A%2001%20Aug%202026%2C%2009%3A33%0A%0AConversation%3A%0ACustomer%3A%20Ji%20mai%20karna%20tahata%20hu%20%209506400958%0ABot%3A%20Namaste%21%20%F0%9F%99%8F%20Shukriya%20aapka%20number%20share%20karne%20ke%20liye.%20%0A%0AAap%20kaun%20sa%20car%20book%20karna%20chahte%20ho%3F%20Aur%20kab%20tak%20ki%20zaroorat%20hai%3F%20Mujhe%20bataao%3A%0A-%20Kitne%20log%20travel%20karenge%3F%0A-%20Budget%20kya%20hai%3F%0A-%20Kaunsa%20date%20pickup%20aur%20kaunsa%20date%20return%3F%0A%0APhir%20main%20aapko%20best%20options%20suggest%20kar%20dunga%21%0ACustomer%3A%20Koi%20sa%20bhi%20kar%20ho%0ABot%3A%20Theek%20hai%21%20Phir%20mujhe%20kuch%20details%20chahiye%3A%0A%0A1.%20