(441,'bmQ9d','chat',1158,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4sa0avbavys","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works at Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick a car & dates** — I''ll help you find the perfect car for your trip and confirm pickup and return date-times.nn2. **See the price** — I''ll show you the exact cost via quote before you book.nn3. **Create booking** — Once you confirm, I''ll create a pending booking and you''ll get a booking link.nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** — Go to the website, pay upfront, and quickly upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar (one-time only).nn5. **Pick up your car** — Show up at the location on your pickup date and drive!nnJust so you know: minimum booking is 24 hours, a refundable security deposit is required, and the advance amount you pay is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:43:17","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(442,'bmQ9d','chat',1159,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4sa0avbavys","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works at Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick a car & dates** — I''ll help you find the perfect car for your trip and confirm pickup and return date-times.nn2. **See the price** — I''ll show you the exact cost via quote before you book.nn3. **Create booking** — Once you confirm, I''ll create a pending booking and you''ll get a booking link.nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** — Go to the website, pay upfront, and quickly upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar (one-time only).nn5. **Pick up your car** — Show up at the location on your pickup date and drive!nnJust so you know: minimum booking is 24 hours, a refundable security deposit is required, and the advance amount you pay is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? 🚗\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have car I want extra income\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I appreciate you thinking of Car Rent Pe! 🚗nnHowever, I''m the booking assistant here — I help customers rent cars. For business inquiries like adding your own vehicle to our fleet or partnership opportunities, please reach out to our team directly:nnContact: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnThey''ll be able to discuss options with you. Good luck!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:44:10","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(443,'bmQ9d','chat',1160,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_343pqik52s3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have sonet petrol car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnI think you might be looking for a **Kia Sonet** in petrol? Unfortunately, we don''t have that model in our current fleet right now.nnHowever, I can suggest some great petrol + CNG alternatives that are similarly spacious and reliable:nn- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day - 5 seatsn- Tata Nexon - ₹2,800/day - 5 seats  n- Maruti Suzuki Brezza - ₹3,500/day - 5 seatsnnWould any of these work for you? Or tell me more about what you need — how many people, budget, or type of trip — and I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:44:55","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(444,'bmQ9d','chat',1161,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_343pqik52s3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have sonet petrol car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnI think you might be looking for a **Kia Sonet** in petrol? Unfortunately, we don''t have that model in our current fleet right now.nnHowever, I can suggest some great petrol + CNG alternatives that are similarly spacious and reliable:nn- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day - 5 seatsn- Tata Nexon - ₹2,800/day - 5 seats  n- Maruti Suzuki Brezza - ₹3,500/day - 5 seatsnnWould any of these work for you? Or tell me more about what you need — how many people, budget, or type of trip — and I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Now I start with my car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 🚗 So you''d like to start a booking with your own car — or did you mean you''d like to rent a car from us to start your trip?nnJust want to clarify so I can help you best! If you''re looking to rent, let me know:n- When do you want to pick up? (date & time)n- How many days/hours?n- How many people will be traveling?nnThat way I can find the perfect car for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:46:17","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(445,'bmQ9d','chat',1162,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_343pqik52s3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have sonet petrol car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnI think you might be looking for a **Kia Sonet** in petrol? Unfortunately, we don''t have that model in our current fleet right now.nnHowever, I can suggest some great petrol + CNG alternatives that are similarly spacious and reliable:nn- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day - 5 seatsn- Tata Nexon - ₹2,800/day - 5 seats  n- Maruti Suzuki Brezza - ₹3,500/day - 5 seatsnnWould any of these work for you? Or tell me more about what you need — how many people, budget, or type of trip — and I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Now I start with my car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 🚗 So you''d like to start a booking with your own car — or did you mean you''d like to rent a car from us to start your trip?nnJust want to clarify so I can help you best! If you''re looking to rent, let me know:n- When do you want to pick up? (date & time)n- How many days/hours?n- How many people will be traveling?nnThat way I can find the perfect car for you!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Morning 7 to Evining\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! So you''re looking for a car from morning at 7 AM to evening. Just a couple more details:nn- What date? (e.g., 15th January)n- What time in the evening? (e.g., 6 PM, 8 PM?)n- How many people will be in the car?nnOnce I know this, I''ll suggest the best options for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:47:00","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(446,'bmQ9d','chat',1163,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_343pqik52s3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have sonet petrol car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnI think you might be looking for a **Kia Sonet** in petrol? Unfortunately, we don''t have that model in our current fleet right now.nnHowever, I can suggest some great petrol + CNG alternatives that are similarly spacious and reliable:nn- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day - 5 seatsn- Tata Nexon - ₹2,800/day - 5 seats  n- Maruti Suzuki Brezza - ₹3,500/day - 5 seatsnnWould any of these work for you? Or tell me more about what you need — how many people, budget, or type of trip — and I can help you find the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Now I start with my car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 🚗 So you''d like to start a booking with your own car — or did you mean you''d like to rent a car from us to start your trip?nnJust want to clarify so I can help you best! If you''re looking to rent, let me know:n- When do you want to pick up? (date & time)n- How many days/hours?n- How many people will be traveling?nnThat way I can find the perfect car for you!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Morning 7 to Evining\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! So you''re looking for a car from morning at 7 AM to evening. Just a couple more details:nn- What date? (e.g., 15th January)n- What time in the evening? (e.g., 6 PM, 8 PM?)n- How many people will be in the car?nnOnce I know this, I''ll suggest the best options for you! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"माझी गाडी आहे मी ड्राइवर आहे मला रेंट वर देयची आहे  आपण काय सांगू shakta\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"आहा, समजलो! 😊 तुमच्या गाडीला रेंट देवायचं आहे — पण हे Car Rent Pe वर शक्य नाही. आम्ही फक्त गाड्या भाड्याने देतो, स्वत:ची गाडी घेत नाही.nnतुम्हाला गाडी रेंट देण्याबद्दल माहिती असेल तर कृपया Contact करा:nhttps://carrentpe.com/contact/nnआमचा टीम तुम्हाला मदत करू शकेल! 🙏nnतुम्हाला आमच्याकडून गाडी भाड्याने घ्यायची असेल तर मी मदत करू शकतो! 😄\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 10:48:14","_zc_chat_turns":"8"}'),
(447,'bmQ9d','chat',1164,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n2xpcea9qs","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste sir\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 🙏 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car for your trip in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and for how many days?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 11:06:54","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(448,'bmQ9d','chat',1165,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n2xpcea9qs","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste sir\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 🙏 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car for your trip in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and for how many days?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Sir meri car white plate he model maruti Eeco 2016\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I see you have a personal car! 😊 But here at Car Rent Pe, we help you *rent* cars for your trips — we have a great fleet of well-maintained vehicles ready to go.nnAre you looking to rent a car for a upcoming trip? If so, tell me:n- How many people are traveling?n- What dates do you need it?n- Any preference (budget-friendly, spacious, etc.)?nnI''ll find the perfect match for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 11:08:04","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
