(495,'bmQ9d','chat',1214,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n1zq2yhr2q","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. I''m here to help you rent a car in Navi Mumbai.nnAre you looking to book a self-drive car, or do you need a car with a driver? And what''s your trip about — a day trip, weekend getaway, or something longer?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 16:56:16","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(496,'bmQ9d','chat',1215,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n1zq2yhr2q","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. I''m here to help you rent a car in Navi Mumbai.nnAre you looking to book a self-drive car, or do you need a car with a driver? And what''s your trip about — a day trip, weekend getaway, or something longer?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I wnat to register my car in carerentpe\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for reaching out! 👋nnI think there might be a small mix-up — Car Rent Pe is a self-drive car rental service where you *rent* cars from us, rather than a platform to register your own vehicle.nnIf you''d like to rent a car from our fleet for your next trip, I''m happy to help! But if you have questions about partnering with us or adding your car to our service, I''d recommend reaching out to our team directly:nnContact: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnThey''ll be able to guide you on any business inquiries. 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 16:56:55","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(497,'bmQ9d','chat',1216,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_kc89kj3t8pa","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe meri car list karni hai\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 👋 Car Rent Pe में आपका स्वागत है!nnAapki car list करने के लिए मुझे कुछ जानकारी चाहिए:nn- कब से कब तक चाहिए? (pickup और return की date-time)n- कितने लोग जाएंगे?n- आपका budget क्या है?nnये बताइए तो मैं आपके लिए best cars suggest कर सकता हूँ! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 17:02:58","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(498,'bmQ9d','chat',1217,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_kc89kj3t8pa","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe meri car list karni hai\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 👋 Car Rent Pe में आपका स्वागत है!nnAapki car list करने के लिए मुझे कुछ जानकारी चाहिए:nn- कब से कब तक चाहिए? (pickup और return की date-time)n- कितने लोग जाएंगे?n- आपका budget क्या है?nnये बताइए तो मैं आपके लिए best cars suggest कर सकता हूँ! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Are bhai mere pass 7 seated car hai mujhe rent pe dena hai\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Aah samjha! 👍 Toh aap apni 7-seater car ko rent pe dena chahte ho?nnMujhe lagta hai aap Car Rent Pe ke fleet mein apni car add करवाना चाहते हो — वो काम हमारे team को करना है। Contact करने के लिए यहाँ जाइए:nnContact: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnWahan se directly baat करिए और बताइए कि आपके पास क्या car है। Team आपको process समझा देगा! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 17:03:38","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(499,'bmQ9d','chat',1218,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ws61tdu194","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mumbai tahir ali mumbai mein rahata hun\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 🙏 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! nnI see you''re in Mumbai. We operate in Navi Mumbai, and all our cars are based at Gavson Business Park in Ghansoli (and one at Panvel Khanda colony). We offer great self-drive car rentals at affordable prices.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? Just tell me:n- How many people will be traveling?n- Budget range you have in mind?n- How many days do you need the car?nnThis will help me suggest the perfect car for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 19:52:53","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(500,'bmQ9d','chat',1219,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_s6z12vemeo","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"हाँ, हमारे पास कई 7-seater cars हैं! 😊nnआपको किस तरह की ट्रिप के लिए चाहिए? Family outing, long drive, या कुछ और? और बजट कितना है - ₹3,300/day के आसपास या ज़्यादा luxury वाली चीज़?nnपहले बताओ तो मैं सही car suggest कर दूँ!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-04 01:52:08","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
