(580,'bmQ9d','chat',1303,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_rperjvi79p7","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want to attract my new car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 🚗 I think you mean you want to **rent** a car – I''d love to help you find the perfect one!nnTo get started, could you tell me:n- How many people will be traveling?n- What''s your budget range?n- When do you need the car (pickup and return dates)?nnThis will help me suggest the best cars for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-08 08:09:56","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(581,'bmQ9d','chat',1304,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_zq4d3500t4q","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** - You tell me what you need, I suggest the perfect fit, and we confirm the car, pickup date-time, and return date-time.nn2. **Get the price** - I''ll show you the exact rental cost using our quote tool.nn3. **Create the booking** - Once you confirm, I collect your name and mobile number, then create your booking as \\\\\\"pending payment.\\\\\\"nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** - You''ll go to our website to pay the advance (the booking amount is non-refundable). Then you''ll do a quick one-time KYC verification with your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar — and you''re all set to pick up!nnA refundable security deposit is also required. Minimum booking is 24 hours; if you keep the car longer, extra hours are charged as full days plus hourly rates.nnSo, what kind of trip are you planning? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-08 09:36:47","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
