(584,'bmQ9d','chat',1307,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_7z1d2jeaijf","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I am looking for AMT CNG+PETROL\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I''ve checked our fleet and I don''t have any cars with AMT transmission that run on both CNG + Petrol together. nnHowever, I have some great alternatives:n- If you want AMT (automatic ease), we have the **Mahindra 7XO** – 7 seats, Diesel, AMT, ₹9000/day. Perfect for comfort and space.n- If you prefer CNG + Petrol with manual transmission, we have many options like **Maruti Suzuki WagonR** (₹2300/day) or **Toyota Glanza** (₹2500/day).nnHow many people are you planning to travel with, and what''s your budget? That''ll help me recommend the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-08 12:24:54","_zc_chat_turns":"2","_zc_chat_name":"Looking For AMT CNG"}'),
(585,'bmQ9d','chat',1308,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_7z1d2jeaijf","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I am looking for AMT CNG+PETROL\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I''ve checked our fleet and I don''t have any cars with AMT transmission that run on both CNG + Petrol together. nnHowever, I have some great alternatives:n- If you want AMT (automatic ease), we have the **Mahindra 7XO** – 7 seats, Diesel, AMT, ₹9000/day. Perfect for comfort and space.n- If you prefer CNG + Petrol with manual transmission, we have many options like **Maruti Suzuki WagonR** (₹2300/day) or **Toyota Glanza** (₹2500/day).nnHow many people are you planning to travel with, and what''s your budget? That''ll help me recommend the perfect car! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Check for AMT CNG+Petrol small car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I''ve checked our entire fleet carefully, and unfortunately we don''t have any small cars with AMT transmission and CNG + Petrol fuel combination. That''s a pretty specific setup!nnYour best options are:n- **Maruti Suzuki WagonR** – 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹2300/day. Compact, budget-friendly, and fuel-efficient.n- **Tata Punch** – 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹2700/day. Stylish compact SUV with great mileage.nnBoth are small, easy to drive, and have the CNG + Petrol combo. Would either of these work for you? When are you looking to book? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-08 12:31:05","_zc_chat_turns":"4","_zc_chat_name":"Looking For AMT CNG"}'),
(586,'bmQ9d','chat',1309,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_jpg4wv780n","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes, we have several 7-seaters! 🚗 What kind of trip are you planning — family holiday, group travel, or business? And what''s your budget range? That''ll help me suggest the best fit for you.nnHere are our 7-seater options:nn- XUV 500, Diesel, ₹4500/dayn- Toyota Innova Crysta, Diesel, ₹5500/dayn- Tata Safari, Automatic Diesel, ₹9000/dayn- Maruti Suzuki Ertiga, Petrol + CNG, ₹3300/dayn- Mahindra XUV700, Diesel, ₹7500/dayn- Mahindra XUV500, Diesel, ₹4500/dayn- Mahindra Scorpio N, Diesel, ₹5500/dayn- Mahindra 7XO, Automatic Diesel, ₹9000/dayn- Kia Carens, Diesel, ₹4500/day\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-08 13:04:00","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
