(592,'bmQ9d','chat',1315,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_1i5hud3k7yn","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick a car & dates** – We chat about what you need, I show you available cars with prices, and you choose one.nn2. **Get a quote** – I calculate the total price for your exact pickup and return dates.nn3. **Book it** – Once you confirm, I create your booking. It starts as pending-payment.nn4. **Pay & complete KYC on our website** – You''ll go to our website, pay the advance, and upload your documents (driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar) for a quick one-time verification.nn5. **Pick up your car** – Once paid and verified, you''re all set to drive!nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. There''s a refundable security deposit and a non-refundable advance booking amount.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? How many people and when? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-10 05:51:43","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
