(655,'bmQ9d','chat',1379,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_wjg2wk4ncyo","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick your car** — Browse our fleet and choose one that fits your needs.n2. **Tell us your dates** — Pickup and return date-time (minimum 24 hours).n3. **Get a quote** — We''ll show you the total price for those dates.n4. **Confirm & book** — You give us your name and phone number, and we create your booking.n5. **Pay on our website** — Your booking is pending until you complete payment and quick KYC (driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar) on carrentpe.com.n6. **Pick up your car** — Come to Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli, and enjoy your ride!nnA refundable security deposit and advance booking amount are required. The advance is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of car are you looking for? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-12 10:18:01","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
