(665,'bmQ9d','chat',1389,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_eq27t3nfwel","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Verify my booking\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi! 👋 I''d be happy to help you verify your booking. To look that up, I''ll need a bit of info from you:nn- Your booking reference number or ID (you should have received this after booking)n- Your name and mobile numbernnCould you share those details? Alternatively, you can visit our Contact page for direct support: https://carrentpe.com/contact/\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Dhiraj Singh, 7715866409\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks Dhiraj! 😊 I have your name and number. To verify your booking, I''ll need your booking reference number or ID — it''s the unique code you got when you made the booking (usually in your confirmation email or on the website).nnOnce you share that, I can help! Or if you''d prefer to check it directly on our website, head to https://carrentpe.com/contact/ and the team can pull it up for you right away.\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-12 15:54:23","_zc_chat_turns":"4","_zc_chat_contact":"7715866409","_zc_chat_phone":"7715866409","_zc_chat_is_lead":"1","_zc_chat_summary_sent":"1","_zc_chat_summary_link":"https://wa.me/918291588796?text=CAR%20RENT%20PE%20%E2%80%94%20WEBSITE%20CHAT%20ENQUIRY%0AName%3A%20Not%20given%0APhone%3A%207715866409%0ATime%3A%2012%20Aug%202026%2C%2015%3A54%0A%0AConversation%3A%0ACustomer%3A%20Verify%20my%20booking%0ABot%3A%20Hi%21%20%F0%9F%91%8B%20I%27d%20be%20happy%20to%20help%20you%20verify%20your%20booking.%20To%20look%20that%20up%2C%20I%27ll%20need%20a%20bit%20of%20info%20from%20you%3A%0A%0A-%20Your%20booking%20reference%20number%20or%20ID%20%28you%20should%20have%20received%20this%20after%20booking%29%0A-%20Your%20name%20and%20mobile%20number%0A%0ACould%20you%20