(679,'bmQ9d','chat',1403,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_awyi9woooq5","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes, we have several 7-seaters! 🚗 nnHere are some great options:nn- Toyota Innova Crysta, Manual, Diesel, ₹5500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-innova-crysta/n- XUV 500, Manual, Diesel, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/xuv-500/n- Maruti Suzuki Ertiga, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹3300/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-ertiga/n- Mahindra XUV700, Manual, Diesel, ₹7500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv700/nnThe Ertiga is the most affordable; the Innova Crysta is premium and spacious. What''s your trip date and budget? That''ll help me suggest the best fit.nnMay I also have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-13 18:42:37","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
