(741,'bmQ9d','chat',1465,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_dtce9b14w2","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Doorstep drop\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnJust to clarify — are you looking to **rent a car with doorstep pickup and drop-off** (we pick it up and drop it off at your home/location)? Or do you mean you''d like to pick up a car and we deliver it to you?nnAlso, quick question: **how many people** will be traveling, and **when** are you planning to rent? That''ll help me suggest the perfect car for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-19 22:20:58","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(742,'bmQ9d','chat',1466,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_dtce9b14w2","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Doorstep drop\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for reaching out to Car Rent Pe.nnJust to clarify — are you looking to **rent a car with doorstep pickup and drop-off** (we pick it up and drop it off at your home/location)? Or do you mean you''d like to pick up a car and we deliver it to you?nnAlso, quick question: **how many people** will be traveling, and **when** are you planning to rent? That''ll help me suggest the perfect car for you! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want car come to my place\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it! 🚗 So you''d like us to bring a car to your place for pickup.nnJust to help you find the perfect match, I have a couple of quick questions:nn1. **How many people** will be traveling?n2. **When do you need the car?** (dates and times)n3. **How long** do you need it for? (1 day, 2 days, etc.)nnOnce I know this, I can suggest the best cars and we can arrange doorstep delivery for you!nnAlso, may I have your **name and mobile number** so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-19 22:21:49","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(743,'bmQ9d','chat',1467,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_916wfn9dhrr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We''ve got a great fleet in Navi Mumbai.nnTo help you find the perfect car, quick question — how many people are you planning to travel with, and what''s your approximate budget per day?nnOnce I know that, I''ll suggest the best options for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-20 06:30:16","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
