(769,'bmQ9d','chat',1493,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_jyueqqp5rio","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"need a kia carnival for 6 people\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 I checked our fleet and we don''t have a Kia Carnival available right now. But I have some great alternatives for 6 people:nn- Maruti Suzuki XL6 (6 seats) - ₹3500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-xl6/n- Maruti Suzuki Ertiga (7 seats) - ₹3300/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-ertiga/n- Kia Carens (6 seats) - ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/kia-carens/nnAll are spacious and comfortable for your group. When are you planning to travel? That''ll help me get you an exact price.nnMay I also have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you better?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 04:18:03","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(770,'bmQ9d','chat',1494,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_dkf4o3mfakv","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Is car rent on km basis.?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Car Rent Pe charges on a **time basis**, not kilometres.nnHere''s how it works:n- Hourly rate (e.g., ₹104/hr for a Maruti Swift)n- Daily rate (e.g., ₹2,500/day for the same car)n- Minimum booking is 24 hoursn- Extra usage beyond a day is charged as full days plus extra hoursnnSo you pay for how long you rent, not how far you drive. This makes road trips more affordable! 🚗nnWhat dates are you thinking of? I can help you find the perfect car.\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 07:27:32","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
