(776,'bmQ9d','chat',1500,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_oyt0zi2kz4","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works at Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick a car & dates** — We chat through what you need, I suggest the best fit, and we confirm the pickup and return date-time.nn2. **Get a quote** — I''ll show you the exact price for your dates.nn3. **Book it** — Once you confirm, I create your booking and give you a link. Your booking is \\\\\\"pending payment\\\\\\" at this stage.nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** — You go to our website, pay your advance (the booking amount is non-refundable, plus a refundable security deposit), and quickly upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar.nn5. **Pick up your car** — Once KYC is done, you''re all set to collect your car at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli!nnMinimum booking is 24 hours, and extra hours beyond full days are charged separately.nnReady to find your perfect car? What''s your trip like — how many people and what dates? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 16:08:36","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(777,'bmQ9d','chat',1501,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3xepu9d0ole","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works with us:nn1. Pick your car and dates — I''ll help you find the perfect fit and show you the price.nn2. Confirm the details — we need your name, phone number, pickup and return date-times, and location.nn3. Get a quote — I''ll calculate the exact cost for your rental.nn4. Create the booking — once you confirm, your booking is created as pending payment.nn5. Complete payment & KYC on our website — you''ll pay the advance amount, and then do a quick one-time verification with your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar.nn6. Pick up your car — and you''re ready to go!nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. All our cars are at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli in Navi Mumbai. nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? How many people and what dates? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 16:10:10","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(778,'bmQ9d','chat',1502,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3xepu9d0ole","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works with us:nn1. Pick your car and dates — I''ll help you find the perfect fit and show you the price.nn2. Confirm the details — we need your name, phone number, pickup and return date-times, and location.nn3. Get a quote — I''ll calculate the exact cost for your rental.nn4. Create the booking — once you confirm, your booking is created as pending payment.nn5. Complete payment & KYC on our website — you''ll pay the advance amount, and then do a quick one-time verification with your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar.nn6. Pick up your car — and you''re ready to go!nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. All our cars are at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli in Navi Mumbai. nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? How many people and what dates? 🚗\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Security refund time\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Good question! I don''t have the specific details on security deposit refund timelines in my system. nnFor that, please reach out to our team via the Contact page: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnThey''ll give you the exact info on when refunds are processed after your trip. 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 16:10:29","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(779,'bmQ9d','chat',1503,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_cenuupypbd9","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have a great fleet available in Navi Mumbai.nnTo help you pick the perfect car, could you tell me — how many people will be traveling and what''s your budget range? That way I can suggest the best matches for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 17:19:48","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(780,'bmQ9d','chat',1504,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_cenuupypbd9","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have a great fleet available in Navi Mumbai.nnTo help you pick the perfect car, could you tell me — how many people will be traveling and what''s your budget range? That way I can suggest the best matches for you! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Send me your contact number\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"You can reach our team through our Contact page here: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnThey''ll be happy to help you with any questions! 😊nnIn the meantime, I''m here to help you find and book a car. What type of trip are you planning?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 17:20:13","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(781,'bmQ9d','chat',1505,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_6vdwucikf3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Documents\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. nnI''m here to help you rent the perfect car in Navi Mumbai. Are you looking to book a car for a trip, or do you have questions about our fleet?nnTo get started, could you tell me:n- When are you planning to pick up and drop off?n- How many people will be traveling?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 18:45:15","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(782,'bmQ9d','chat',1506,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_6vdwucikf3","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Documents\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. nnI''m here to help you rent the perfect car in Navi Mumbai. Are you looking to book a car for a trip, or do you have questions about our fleet?nnTo get started, could you tell me:n- When are you planning to pick up and drop off?n- How many people will be traveling?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"6\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it — 6 people! That helps. 🚗nnFor a group of 6, I''d recommend these spacious options:nn- Maruti Suzuki XL6, 6 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹3500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-xl6/n- Mahindra XUV500, 7 seats, Manual, Diesel, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv500/n- Kia Carens, 6 seats, Manual, Diesel, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/kia-carens/nnWhen are you planning to pick up and drop off?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-22 18:45:35","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(783,'bmQ9d','chat',1507,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n7mzu6nlqj","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes, we do! 🚗 We have several 7-seaters available. Here are some great options:nn- Toyota Innova Crysta, Diesel, Manual, ₹5500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-innova-crysta/n- Maruti Suzuki Ertiga, Petrol + CNG, Manual, ₹3300/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-ertiga/n- XUV 500, Diesel, Manual, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/xuv-500/n- Mahindra XUV700, Diesel, Manual, ₹7500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv700/n- Mahindra Scorpio N, Diesel, Manual, ₹5500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-scorpio-n/n- Mahindra 7XO, Diesel, AMT, ₹9000/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-7xo/n- Kia Carens, Diesel, Manual, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/kia-carens/nnThe Maruti Ertiga is great value if you want comfort for a family. What''s your budget and dates in mind?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-23 04:12:02","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(784,'bmQ9d','chat',1508,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_hdf98k00pts","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 To help you find the perfect car, let me ask — how many people will be traveling, and how long are you looking to rent for? This will help me narrow down the best options for you!nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-23 07:04:39","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
