(829,'bmQ9d','chat',1553,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3ebn1ec6fla","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 To help you find the perfect car, could you tell me a bit about your trip? For example:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- Is this for a short city drive, a long road trip, or something else?nnThis way I can suggest the best-fit cars for you instead of listing everything!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:13:02","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(830,'bmQ9d','chat',1554,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3ebn1ec6fla","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 To help you find the perfect car, could you tell me a bit about your trip? For example:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- Is this for a short city drive, a long road trip, or something else?nnThis way I can suggest the best-fit cars for you instead of listing everything!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hello\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! How can I help you today? Are you looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:13:17","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(831,'bmQ9d','chat',1555,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3ebn1ec6fla","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 To help you find the perfect car, could you tell me a bit about your trip? For example:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- Is this for a short city drive, a long road trip, or something else?nnThis way I can suggest the best-fit cars for you instead of listing everything!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hello\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! How can I help you today? Are you looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe car rent me lena hau\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Bilkul! 😊 Main aapko sahi car dhundne mein madad kar dunga.nnBas ek baat batao:n- Kitne log travel kar rahe ho?n- Aapka budget kya hai?n- Kab se kab tak car chahiye?nnIsse mujhe pata chal jayega ki kaun si car perfect rahegi aapke liye!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:13:46","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(832,'bmQ9d','chat',1556,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_3ebn1ec6fla","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 To help you find the perfect car, could you tell me a bit about your trip? For example:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- Is this for a short city drive, a long road trip, or something else?nnThis way I can suggest the best-fit cars for you instead of listing everything!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hello\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! How can I help you today? Are you looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe car rent me lena hau\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Bilkul! 😊 Main aapko sahi car dhundne mein madad kar dunga.nnBas ek baat batao:n- Kitne log travel kar rahe ho?n- Aapka budget kya hai?n- Kab se kab tak car chahiye?nnIsse mujhe pata chal jayega ki kaun si car perfect rahegi aapke liye!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Aaj se kal tak our 5 travel\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! 5 logon ke liye aaj se kal tak — main aapko kuch best options suggest karta hoon:nn1. Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day, 5 seater. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-swift/nn2. Tata Nexon - ₹2,800/day, 5 seater, thoda spacious. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/tata-nexon/nn3. Maruti Suzuki WagonR - ₹2,300/day, budget-friendly. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-wagonr/nnKaun sa car pasand aaya? Aur mujhe aapka naam aur mobile number bhi de sakte ho taaki hum aapko best offers bhej sakein? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:14:35","_zc_chat_turns":"8"}'),
(833,'bmQ9d','chat',1557,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_gzzpqcgevyw","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how booking with Car Rent Pe works:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** — We help you find the right car from our fleet, and you choose pickup and return dates/times.nn2. **Get a quote** — We show you the total price for your rental.nn3. **Create the booking** — Once you confirm, we create your booking (it starts as pending payment).nn4. **Pay & complete KYC on our website** — You''ll go to our website to pay the advance amount. Then you''ll upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar to complete a quick one-time verification.nn5. **Pick up your car** — Once paid and verified, you''re ready to pick up at our location in Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli!nnA few things to note: minimum booking is 24 hours, a refundable security deposit is required, and the advance/booking amount is non-refundable.nnReady to find the perfect car? May I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:19:36","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(834,'bmQ9d','chat',1558,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_kfue5aldkmd","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Affordable car for a day\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 👍 For an affordable car, we have some lovely budget-friendly options. Just to help me pick the perfect one — is this for city driving, a road trip, or something else? And roughly how many people?nnIn the meantime, here are our most affordable picks at ₹2,300–₹2,500/day:nn- Maruti Suzuki WagonR - ₹2,300/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-wagonr/n- Toyota Urban Cruiser Taisor - ₹2,500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-urban-cruiser-taisor/n- Maruti Suzuki Swift - ₹2,500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-swift/n- Tata Altroz - ₹2,500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/tata-altroz-2/nnAll are 5 seats, perfect for solo travelers or small groups. Which appeals to you?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 04:20:05","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(835,'bmQ9d','chat',1559,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_zkiacfwg3cb","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how booking with Car Rent Pe works:nn**1. Pick your car & dates** — Browse our fleet, choose a car that fits your needs, and tell us your pickup and return dates/times.nn**2. Get a quote** — We''ll show you the exact price for your rental.nn**3. Confirm & book** — Once you''re happy, we''ll create a pending booking (you give us your name and phone number).nn**4. Pay on our website** — Your booking is created, but it''s not final until you visit our website, complete payment, and do a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar).nn**5. Pick up your car** — You''re all set! Come to Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli and drive away.nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and your advance/booking amount is non-refundable.nnSo, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and roughly what dates? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-26 05:26:24","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
