(868,'bmQ9d','chat',1593,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_y1nnweeu23l","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 To suggest the perfect car for you, tell me quickly — how many people are traveling and what''s your trip like (city drive, highway, family outing)?nnOnce I know, I''ll show you the best options! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-29 20:38:22","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(869,'bmQ9d','chat',1594,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_y1nnweeu23l","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 To suggest the perfect car for you, tell me quickly — how many people are traveling and what''s your trip like (city drive, highway, family outing)?nnOnce I know, I''ll show you the best options! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"2 log Mujhe aisi car chahiye jisme driver aur rear seat ke beech completely opaque/solid privacy partition ho. Partition bilkul transparent ya see-through nahi hona chahiye, aur side/rear windows par bhi opaque curtains/blinds hon. Driver ko rear seat par baithe passengers bilkul bhi visible nahi hone chahiye\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it! You need a car for 2 people with complete privacy from the driver — solid partition, no transparency, and opaque curtains on windows. 🚗nnMujhe samajh aaya, lekin ye specific privacy setup (solid partition + opaque curtains) Car Rent Pe ke standard fleet mein nahi hai. Humara fleet normal cars hain jisme driver''s cabin aur rear seats normally connected hote hain.nnAapke liye iska best option tha ek **taxi/cab service with privacy partition**, but woh humara service nahi hai.nnKya aap kisi aur tarah ki car soch rahe ho — jaise basic sedan ya SUV jisme aap baithe raho? Ya aapko kisi specific purpose ke liye ye privacy chahiye? Main aapko madad kar sakta hoon agar aap thoda aur bataao! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-29 20:41:13","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(870,'bmQ9d','chat',1595,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_y1nnweeu23l","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 To suggest the perfect car for you, tell me quickly — how many people are traveling and what''s your trip like (city drive, highway, family outing)?nnOnce I know, I''ll show you the best options! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"2 log Mujhe aisi car chahiye jisme driver aur rear seat ke beech completely opaque/solid privacy partition ho. Partition bilkul transparent ya see-through nahi hona chahiye, aur side/rear windows par bhi opaque curtains/blinds hon. Driver ko rear seat par baithe passengers bilkul bhi visible nahi hone chahiye\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it! You need a car for 2 people with complete privacy from the driver — solid partition, no transparency, and opaque curtains on windows. 🚗nnMujhe samajh aaya, lekin ye specific privacy setup (solid partition + opaque curtains) Car Rent Pe ke standard fleet mein nahi hai. Humara fleet normal cars hain jisme driver''s cabin aur rear seats normally connected hote hain.nnAapke liye iska best option tha ek **taxi/cab service with privacy partition**, but woh humara service nahi hai.nnKya aap kisi aur tarah ki car soch rahe ho — jaise basic sedan ya SUV jisme aap baithe raho? Ya aapko kisi specific purpose ke liye ye privacy chahiye? Main aapko madad kar sakta hoon agar aap thoda aur bataao! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"“Mujhe normal car nahi chahiye. Mujhe driver aur rear seat ke beech completely solid/opaque partition wali car chahiye, jisme driver ko rear seat bilkul na dikhe. Kya aap kisi aisi car/service ka contact de sakte hain?”\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Samjh gaya, aapko specialized privacy partition wali car chahiye — wo Car Rent Pe ke fleet mein nahi hai.nnAapke liye best hoga ki aap humari Contact page par jaao aur directly team se pooch lo. Vo aapko proper guidance de payenge ya kisi specialized service ka reference de payenge.nnContact: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnAgar aap koi aur car rental need ho to main madad kar sakta hoon! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-29 20:43:48","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(871,'bmQ9d','chat',1596,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4npaq13aapm","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how booking works with Car Rent Pe:nn**1. Pick your car & dates** — I''ll help you find the perfect car and confirm your pickup and return dates.nn**2. Get a quote** — I''ll show you the exact price for your rental.nn**3. Create the booking** — Once you confirm, I''ll create your booking (it starts as pending payment).nn**4. Pay & verify on our website** — You''ll complete payment and a quick one-time KYC (submit your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar). That''s it!nn**A few quick notes:** Minimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and the advance/booking amount is non-refundable. You''ll need your KYC docs ready before pickup.nnWhat kind of car are you looking for? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 05:33:36","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(872,'bmQ9d','chat',1597,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_l27alsd9fyr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"If the tata punch per hr charges 113 then what will be charged for 5hrs\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"For the Tata Punch at ₹113/hr, 5 hours would cost:nn5 × ₹113 = ₹565nnThat''s the hourly rate. Keep in mind, Car Rent Pe charges a minimum of 24 hours (one full day at ₹2,700), so if you''re booking for just 5 hours, the full day rate would apply. Once you go beyond 24 hours, extra usage is charged as full days plus extra hours.nnAre you planning a short trip, or would you like to book the Tata Punch for a full day or longer? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 07:23:37","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(873,'bmQ9d','chat',1598,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_l27alsd9fyr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"If the tata punch per hr charges 113 then what will be charged for 5hrs\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"For the Tata Punch at ₹113/hr, 5 hours would cost:nn5 × ₹113 = ₹565nnThat''s the hourly rate. Keep in mind, Car Rent Pe charges a minimum of 24 hours (one full day at ₹2,700), so if you''re booking for just 5 hours, the full day rate would apply. Once you go beyond 24 hours, extra usage is charged as full days plus extra hours.nnAre you planning a short trip, or would you like to book the Tata Punch for a full day or longer? 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Short trip\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it! For a short trip under 24 hours, you''d still pay the minimum day rate of ₹2,700 for the Tata Punch.nnHow many hours do you need the car for, and when are you planning to pick it up? Once I know your dates and times, I can confirm the exact price for you.nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 07:24:36","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(874,'bmQ9d','chat',1599,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_r6mn4iy5xvh","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Car provided on door step or need to be pick from hub\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Good question! Based on our service, all cars are picked up from our hub at **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli** in Navi Mumbai. You''ll need to come to the location to collect your car at your scheduled pickup time.nnAre you looking to rent a car for a specific trip? If you let me know your dates and how many people you need to travel, I can suggest the perfect car for you! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 07:26:40","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(875,'bmQ9d','chat',1600,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_h994rofensq","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Please arrange my call\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I''d be happy to help! 😊nnTo arrange a callback, please visit our Contact page where you can leave your details and we''ll get back to you: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnAlternatively, you can tell me what you need — are you looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai? I''m here to help you find the perfect vehicle and book it!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 13:53:14","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
