(878,'bmQ9d','chat',1603,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_bnhqm3ku6ub","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works with Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** — Tell me what you need (trip type, how many people, budget) and I''ll suggest the perfect car for you.nn2. **Get a quote** — I''ll show you the exact price for your dates.nn3. **Confirm & book** — Once you''re happy, I collect your name and phone number, then create your booking as pending-payment.nn4. **Pay on website** — You''ll go to our website, complete payment, and then do a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar).nn5. **Pick up & enjoy** — Once KYC is done, you''re all set to collect your car! ✓nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and the advance/booking amount is non-refundable.nnReady to find your car? What''s your trip about? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 18:49:31","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(879,'bmQ9d','chat',1604,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_bnhqm3ku6ub","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works with Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** — Tell me what you need (trip type, how many people, budget) and I''ll suggest the perfect car for you.nn2. **Get a quote** — I''ll show you the exact price for your dates.nn3. **Confirm & book** — Once you''re happy, I collect your name and phone number, then create your booking as pending-payment.nn4. **Pay on website** — You''ll go to our website, complete payment, and then do a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar).nn5. **Pick up & enjoy** — Once KYC is done, you''re all set to collect your car! ✓nnThe minimum booking is 24 hours. A refundable security deposit is required, and the advance/booking amount is non-refundable.nnReady to find your car? What''s your trip about? 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Call me 🤙\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 🤙 I''m here to help you book the perfect car, but I chat through this window. nnWhat''s your trip looking like? Tell me:n- When do you need the car? (dates & times)n- How many people?n- Any preference (budget, type of car)?nnI''ll find you the best match! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-30 18:49:46","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
