(882,'bmQ9d','chat',1607,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_djxcicykph4","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do I need to submit my license\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes, you''ll need to submit your driving licence as part of our quick one-time KYC (Know Your Customer) process. nnAlong with your licence, you''ll also need to provide your PAN and Aadhaar before you can pick up your car. This is done on our website after you''ve made your booking and completed payment — it''s fast and straightforward! 🚗nnAre you ready to book a car, or do you have questions about what type of vehicle you need?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 05:29:24","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(883,'bmQ9d','chat',1608,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_25ph84f2xfl","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 We''ve got a great fleet. To help you pick the perfect car, tell me:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- What kind of trip (city, highway, adventure)?nnOr if you''d like, I can show you our most popular options across different price ranges!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 05:38:39","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(884,'bmQ9d','chat',1609,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_25ph84f2xfl","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 We''ve got a great fleet. To help you pick the perfect car, tell me:nn- How many people are traveling?n- What''s your budget range per day?n- What kind of trip (city, highway, adventure)?nnOr if you''d like, I can show you our most popular options across different price ranges!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"7 seater\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! For 7 seaters, here are your options:nn- XUV 500, 7 seats, Diesel, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/xuv-500/n- Toyota Innova Crysta, 7 seats, Diesel, ₹5500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-innova-crysta/n- Maruti Suzuki Ertiga, 7 seats, Petrol + CNG, ₹3300/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-ertiga/n- Mahindra XUV700, 7 seats, Diesel, ₹7500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv700/n- Mahindra Scorpio N, 7 seats, Diesel, ₹5500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-scorpio-n/n- Mahindra 7XO, 7 seats, Diesel (Automatic), ₹9000/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-7xo/n- Kia Carens, 6 seats, Diesel, ₹4500/day. Book: https://carrentpe.com/cars/kia-carens/nnMy pick: **Maruti Suzuki Ertiga** — great value at ₹3300/day and super practical for family trips!nnWhich one interests you, or would you like help booking? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 05:38:58","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(885,'bmQ9d','chat',1610,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_hykz0m0circ","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works:nn1. Pick a car - I''ll help you find one that fits your trip, dates, and budget.n2. Get a quote - We show you the exact price for your dates.n3. Book it - You give me your name and mobile number, and we create your booking (it''s pending payment at this stage).n4. Pay & verify - You go to our website to pay and complete a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar). Then you''re all set to pick up! 🚗nnMinimum booking is 24 hours. We also require a refundable security deposit.nnReady to find the perfect car? Tell me — how many people are traveling and what dates do you need it for?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 07:15:06","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(886,'bmQ9d','chat',1611,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_hykz0m0circ","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! Here''s how it works:nn1. Pick a car - I''ll help you find one that fits your trip, dates, and budget.n2. Get a quote - We show you the exact price for your dates.n3. Book it - You give me your name and mobile number, and we create your booking (it''s pending payment at this stage).n4. Pay & verify - You go to our website to pay and complete a quick one-time KYC (upload your driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar). Then you''re all set to pick up! 🚗nnMinimum booking is 24 hours. We also require a refundable security deposit.nnReady to find the perfect car? Tell me — how many people are traveling and what dates do you need it for?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Plz call\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I appreciate you reaching out! I''m a chat assistant, so I can''t call — but I''m here to help you book right now through this chat. 😊nnIf you''d prefer to speak with someone directly, you can contact our team here:nContact: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnOr just let me know your travel dates and how many people, and I''ll help you find and book the perfect car!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 07:15:20","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
