(896,'bmQ9d','chat',1621,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_yx3egq7a4oo","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works with Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick a car** — Browse our fleet and choose what fits your trip (we have 5-seaters, 7-seaters, budget to premium options).nn2. **Tell us your dates** — Give us pickup and return date-times. Minimum booking is 24 hours.nn3. **Get the price** — We''ll show you the total cost before you book.nn4. **Confirm & book** — Share your name and mobile number, and we''ll create your booking (it''s pending payment at this stage).nn5. **Complete on our website** — You''ll pay the advance/booking amount, then do a quick one-time KYC (upload driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar) to confirm.nn6. **Pick up your car** — Show up at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli with your documents and enjoy your ride!nnA refundable security deposit is also required. All cars are self-drive — you drive yourself.nnWhat dates and type of car are you thinking? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-31 16:53:06","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
