(938,'bmQ9d','chat',1663,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_jvp2a7jw19","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. Looking to rent a self-drive car in Navi Mumbai? I''m here to help you find the perfect one.nnQuick question — how many people will be traveling, and what kind of trip is it? That''ll help me suggest the right car for you.\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-09-04 10:49:39","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(939,'bmQ9d','chat',1664,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_jvp2a7jw19","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. Looking to rent a self-drive car in Navi Mumbai? I''m here to help you find the perfect one.nnQuick question — how many people will be traveling, and what kind of trip is it? That''ll help me suggest the right car for you.\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Number plate yellow or white\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Both yellow and white number plates are available in our fleet — we don''t have a restriction on that. nnYellow plates are typically for commercial/taxi use, and white plates for personal vehicles, so it depends on what you need for your trip.nnNow, to find you the right car — how many people are traveling, and roughly what''s your budget range? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-09-04 10:49:52","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(940,'bmQ9d','chat',1665,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_jvp2a7jw19","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. Looking to rent a self-drive car in Navi Mumbai? I''m here to help you find the perfect one.nnQuick question — how many people will be traveling, and what kind of trip is it? That''ll help me suggest the right car for you.\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Number plate yellow or white\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Both yellow and white number plates are available in our fleet — we don''t have a restriction on that. nnYellow plates are typically for commercial/taxi use, and white plates for personal vehicles, so it depends on what you need for your trip.nnNow, to find you the right car — how many people are traveling, and roughly what''s your budget range? 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I need only white number plate car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it — you need a white number plate car for personal use. All our cars at Car Rent Pe come with white plates, so you''re all set! nnNow, to suggest the perfect car for you — how many people will be traveling and what dates are you looking at? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-09-04 10:50:25","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(941,'bmQ9d','chat',1666,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_wro7zbqp38","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"BMW 520 D\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Thanks for your interest. I don''t have a BMW 520 D in our fleet — we focus on self-drive rentals in Navi Mumbai with cars like Toyota, Maruti, Tata, Mahindra, and Kia.nnWhat''s your trip like? Are you looking for a sedan, an SUV, or something spacious for a group? I can find the perfect car for you from what we have available.nnMay I also have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you better?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-09-04 10:58:07","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(942,'bmQ9d','chat',1667,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_nmjjx7hx5m8","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Can you deliver car door step\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for reaching out! Car Rent Pe operates from **Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli** in Navi Mumbai — that''s where you''ll pick up and drop off the car.nnWe don''t offer doorstep delivery, but all our cars are available at one convenient location. If you have questions about pickup or need special arrangements, I''d recommend checking our **Contact page**: https://carrentpe.com/contact/nnCan I help you find the right car for your trip? 😊 What dates are you looking to rent, and how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-09-04 10:59:38","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
