(996,'mdiUe(3)','chat',231,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_fxd7qkmc0j8","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have some great options available in Navi Mumbai.nnBefore I show you our cars, what''s your trip like — are you traveling solo, with family, or a group? And roughly how many days are you looking to rent? This helps me suggest the perfect fit for you!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-08 11:40:43","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(997,'mdiUe(3)','chat',232,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_fxd7qkmc0j8","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have some great options available in Navi Mumbai.nnBefore I show you our cars, what''s your trip like — are you traveling solo, with family, or a group? And roughly how many days are you looking to rent? This helps me suggest the perfect fit for you!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"3 days villa trip, with family\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! A 3-day family villa trip sounds lovely. 🏡 Here are our best options for you:nn1. Maruti Suzuki Fronx - ₹3,600/day, 5 seats, Automatic (easy to drive, spacious for family)n   Book: https://staging.carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-brezza/nn2. Maruti Suzuki Baleno - ₹2,808/day, 5 seats, Manual + CNG option (budget-friendly, fuel-efficient)n   Book: https://staging.carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-thar-roxx/nnBoth fit your family well. The Fronx is more premium and automatic, while the Baleno is great value. Which one interests you?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you with the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-08 11:41:40","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
