(1101,'mdiUe(3)','chat',462,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"95O9497566\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for sharing that number! 😊 Just to confirm — is that your mobile number? And may I have your name as well so our team can assist you better?nnIn the meantime, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and what dates are you looking at?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:11:11","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
