(1248,'mdiUe(3)','chat',964,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_boinrvzsk9o","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"It is self driving.\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes, that''s right! Car Rent Pe is a self-drive rental service — you drive the car yourself. 🚗nnSo, what brings you here today? Are you planning a family trip, a weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-23 11:15:15","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1249,'mdiUe(3)','chat',967,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_a4480selldq","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want to set my car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. I''d love to help you rent a car!nnJust to understand your needs better — how many people will be travelling, and what''s your budget or preferred trip duration? That''ll help me suggest the perfect car for you. 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-23 13:52:44","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1250,'mdiUe(3)','chat',968,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_a4480selldq","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I want to set my car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. I''d love to help you rent a car!nnJust to understand your needs better — how many people will be travelling, and what''s your budget or preferred trip duration? That''ll help me suggest the perfect car for you. 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Muje meri car lagani he isme\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Haan samjha! Toh aap apni car rent pe dena chahte ho? nnMujhe samjhane mein madad karo — kaunse din ke liye aur kitne din ke liye car chahiye? Aur kitne log travel karenge? Phir main aapko sahi car suggest kar dunga! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-23 13:53:25","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(1251,'mdiUe(3)','chat',969,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_gbv1lsiz0i8","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have  own car i want give on rent\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for reaching out! I appreciate your interest, but Car Rent Pe is a car rental platform where customers book cars from our fleet to rent them — we don''t currently offer a service for owners to list their own vehicles.nnIf you have questions about renting a car from us, I''m here to help! Otherwise, for other inquiries, please visit our Contact page: https://staging.carrentpe.com/contact/nnHow can I assist you today? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-23 18:44:32","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1252,'mdiUe(3)','chat',972,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_2lc3vv3w3dw","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works with Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** - Choose a car that suits your trip and tell us your pickup and return dates/times.nn2. **Get a quote** - We''ll show you the total price for your rental.nn3. **Confirm & book** - Once you''re happy, we take your name and phone number and create your booking (it''s pending payment at this stage).nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** - You''ll go to our website to pay upfront. Then you do a quick one-time KYC (upload driving licence, PAN, Aadhaar) to confirm everything.nn5. **Pick up & enjoy** - Come to Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli and drive off!nnA few things to note: minimum booking is 24 hours, a security deposit is refundable, and your booking amount is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? I can suggest the perfect car for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-24 05:38:34","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
