entpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-wagonr/nnTata Nexon - ₹2,800/day. Book: https://staging.carrentpe.com/cars/tata-nexon/nnAll are comfortable 5-seaters, reliable, and great value. The WagonR is our most budget-friendly; the Nexon offers a bit more space and style. Which one appeals to you, or would you like to see more options?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-30 03:33:33","_zc_chat_turns":"10"}'),
