(1376,'mdiUe(3)','chat',1150,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_sjzz3r0ffpq","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** — I''ll help you find the right car for your trip and confirm pickup/return dates and times.nn2. **Get a quote** — I''ll show you the exact price for your booking.nn3. **Share your details** — Once you''re happy, I''ll need your name and mobile number to create the booking.nn4. **Complete payment & KYC** — Your booking goes \\\\\\"pending payment.\\\\\\" You''ll then go to our website to pay the advance, and complete a quick one-time KYC check (upload your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar) to confirm.nn5. **Pick up your car** — You''re all set to collect your car at the agreed date and time!nnA few things to know: minimum booking is 24 hours, and we require a refundable security deposit. The advance you pay is non-refundable.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? I can suggest the perfect car for you! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-01 07:07:56","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
