(1439,'mdiUe(3)','chat',1215,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_n1zq2yhr2q","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I have car\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. I''m here to help you rent a car in Navi Mumbai.nnAre you looking to book a self-drive car, or do you need a car with a driver? And what''s your trip about — a day trip, weekend getaway, or something longer?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I wnat to register my car in carerentpe\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for reaching out! 👋nnI think there might be a small mix-up — Car Rent Pe is a self-drive car rental service where you *rent* cars from us, rather than a platform to register your own vehicle.nnIf you''d like to rent a car from our fleet for your next trip, I''m happy to help! But if you have questions about partnering with us or adding your car to our service, I''d recommend reaching out to our team directly:nnContact: https://staging.carrentpe.com/contact/nnThey''ll be able to guide you on any business inquiries. 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 16:56:55","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
