(1441,'mdiUe(3)','chat',1217,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_kc89kj3t8pa","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe meri car list karni hai\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 👋 Car Rent Pe में आपका स्वागत है!nnAapki car list करने के लिए मुझे कुछ जानकारी चाहिए:nn- कब से कब तक चाहिए? (pickup और return की date-time)n- कितने लोग जाएंगे?n- आपका budget क्या है?nnये बताइए तो मैं आपके लिए best cars suggest कर सकता हूँ! 😊\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Are bhai mere pass 7 seated car hai mujhe rent pe dena hai\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Aah samjha! 👍 Toh aap apni 7-seater car ko rent pe dena chahte ho?nnMujhe lagta hai aap Car Rent Pe ke fleet mein apni car add करवाना चाहते हो — वो काम हमारे team को करना है। Contact करने के लिए यहाँ जाइए:nnContact: https://staging.carrentpe.com/contact/nnWahan se directly baat करिए और बताइए कि आपके पास क्या car है। Team आपको process समझा देगा! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 17:03:38","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(1442,'mdiUe(3)','chat',1218,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ws61tdu194","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mumbai tahir ali mumbai mein rahata hun\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Namaste! 🙏 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! nnI see you''re in Mumbai. We operate in Navi Mumbai, and all our cars are based at Gavson Business Park in Ghansoli (and one at Panvel Khanda colony). We offer great self-drive car rentals at affordable prices.nnWhat kind of trip are you planning? Just tell me:n- How many people will be traveling?n- Budget range you have in mind?n- How many days do you need the car?nnThis will help me suggest the perfect car for you! 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-08-03 19:52:53","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
