(1516,'nA0jk','chat',157,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_dmmkd0a3sec","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have some great options in Navi Mumbai.nnBefore I show you what''s available, a quick question — how many people will be travelling, and what''s your budget range? That''ll help me suggest the perfect car for you.nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"5 seater\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! We have 4 great 5-seater options available at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli:nn- Toyota Glanza - ₹117/hr or ₹2,808/day (Manual, Petrol). Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-glanza/nn- Toyota Glanza (CNG) - ₹117/hr or ₹2,808/day (Manual, Petrol+CNG). Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/tata-altroz/nn- Maruti Suzuki Fronx - ₹150/hr or ₹3,600/day (Automatic, Petrol). Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-brezza/nn- Maruti Suzuki Baleno - ₹117/hr or ₹2,808/day (Manual, Petrol+CNG). Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-thar-roxx/nnThe Fronx is great if you want automatic comfort, while the Glanza and Baleno are budget-friendly options. Which one interests you, or would you like help picking based on your trip dates?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-08 08:14:29","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
