(1526,'nA0jk','chat',200,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ihhik6e1x9","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great question! Here''s how it works with Car Rent Pe:nn1. **Pick your car & dates** - I help you choose the right car for your trip and confirm your pickup and return date-times.nn2. **See the price** - I''ll show you the exact rental cost before you commit.nn3. **Create the booking** - Once you confirm, I''ll create your booking with your name and mobile number. It starts as \\\\\\"pending payment.\\\\\\"nn4. **Pay & complete KYC** - You''ll go to our website to pay the advance. Then you do a quick one-time verification with your driving licence, PAN, and Aadhaar.nn5. **Pick up your car** - You''re all set to collect your car at the location!nnSo, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and roughly what dates? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-08 10:09:03","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
