(1617,'nA0jk','chat',440,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ez6fx0rnyie","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hii\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — are you planning a trip, need a car for a few days, or just exploring options?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hello driving ka job chahiye please\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! I appreciate your interest, but Car Rent Pe is a self-drive car rental service — we rent cars to customers for short trips and longer periods. We don''t have driving jobs available right now.nnFor job inquiries, I''d suggest reaching out to our team directly via the Contact page: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/contact/nnIs there anything else I can help you with? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-10 05:54:45","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(1618,'nA0jk','chat',441,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4sgkwgo1jic","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hii\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! Looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?nnTo help you find the perfect match, could you tell me — how many people will be traveling and roughly what dates are you looking at?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-10 06:08:33","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1619,'nA0jk','chat',442,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4sgkwgo1jic","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hii\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! Looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?nnTo help you find the perfect match, could you tell me — how many people will be traveling and roughly what dates are you looking at?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Bolo\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Sorry, I didn''t quite catch that! 😊 nnAre you looking to rent a car? If so, just let me know:n- How many passengers?n- What dates (pickup and return)?nnAnd feel free to share your name and mobile number whenever you''re ready!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-10 06:08:42","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(1620,'nA0jk','chat',443,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4sgkwgo1jic","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hii\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! Looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai?nnTo help you find the perfect match, could you tell me — how many people will be traveling and roughly what dates are you looking at?nnAlso, may I have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Bolo\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Sorry, I didn''t quite catch that! 😊 nnAre you looking to rent a car? If so, just let me know:n- How many passengers?n- What dates (pickup and return)?nnAnd feel free to share your name and mobile number whenever you''re ready!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Mujhe job ki jarurat hai driving karta hun\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ah, I understand you''re looking for a driving job! 😊nnUnfortunately, Car Rent Pe is a car rental service — we help customers rent self-drive cars, not hire drivers for jobs.nnFor job opportunities, I''d suggest checking job portals or contacting our team directly at the Contact page: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/contact/nnBut if you ever need to rent a car for yourself, I''m here to help!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-10 06:10:12","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(1621,'nA0jk','chat',446,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_oz6qho9lqgo","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"How does booking work?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"अरे, बहुत आसान है! 😊nnयहाँ हमारे booking के 4 स्टेप हैं:nn1. **Car चुनो** — अपना budget और ज़रूरत के हिसाब से car pick करो (हमारे पास 5-seater cars हैं ₹2808 से शुरू)nn2. **Dates और क्या चाहिए वो बताओ** — कब pickup करना है, कब return करना है, और driver चाहिए या नहींnn3. **Price confirm करो और details दो** — हम quote दिखाएंगे, फिर तुम्हारा नाम और mobile number लेंगेnn4. **Website पर payment करो और KYC complete करो** — Booking pending रहेगी जब तक तुम website पर जाकर payment न कर दो। उसके बाद licence, PAN, Aadhaar की copy upload करनी हैnnतो क्या मैं कोई specific car के लिए help कर सकता हूँ? कितने days के लिए सोच रहे हो? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 02:48:56","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1622,'nA0jk','chat',447,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_a70r9mtg05f","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I m driver\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Great to hear. Are you looking to **rent a car for yourself** or are you interested in **working as a driver** with Car Rent Pe?nnIf you''d like to rent a car, just let me know your dates and how long you need it for — I can help you find the perfect fit!\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 05:00:42","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1623,'nA0jk','chat',448,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_a70r9mtg05f","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"I m driver\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Great to hear. Are you looking to **rent a car for yourself** or are you interested in **working as a driver** with Car Rent Pe?nnIf you''d like to rent a car, just let me know your dates and how long you need it for — I can help you find the perfect fit!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Yes\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! Let me help you find the right car. 😊nnA quick question: **how many days are you planning to rent for, and when would you like to pick it up?** That way I can suggest the best options and show you the prices.\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 05:01:10","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
