(1628,'nA0jk','chat',455,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_pxtz9kl30hm","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Aajash\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"नमस्ते! 👋 Car Rent Pe में आपका स्वागत है। nnमुझे बताइए, आप किस तरह की कार ढूंढ रहे हैं? कितने लोग यात्रा करेंगे, या फिर आपका बजट क्या है?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Aakashkanojiy\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"अरे, मैं समझ गया! 😊 तो आप Aakash हो?nnअभी बस बताओ — कब की कार चाहिए? कितने दिन के लिए? और कितने लोग जाएंगे?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"3\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"ठीक है, 3 लोग हैं। अब मुझे बताओ:nn1. कब pickup चाहिए? (तारीख और समय)n2. कितने दिन के लिए?nnएक बार ये बता दो, फिर मैं तुम्हें सही कार सुझा दूंगा। 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 06:26:59","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(1629,'nA0jk','chat',456,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_q7bc4jxjv4h","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! How can I help you today? Are you looking to rent a car in Navi Mumbai for a trip, daily commute, or something else?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 07:19:36","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1630,'nA0jk','chat',457,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_4em4g1cclij","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Great! 🚗 We have 4 fantastic cars available at Gavson Business Park, Ghansoli. Here''s what we''ve got:nn- Toyota Glanza, 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/toyota-glanza/nn- Maruti Suzuki Fronx (Manual), 5 seats, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx-2/nn- Maruti Suzuki Fronx (Automatic), 5 seats, Petrol, ₹150/hr or ₹3600/day. Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-fronx/nn- Maruti Suzuki Baleno, 5 seats, Manual, Petrol + CNG, ₹117/hr or ₹2808/day. Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/maruti-suzuki-baleno/nnAll are 5-seaters, perfect for small groups or families. What kind of trip are you planning — a short getaway or longer rental?nnMay I also have your name and mobile number so our team can assist you and share the best offers? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 08:07:51","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1631,'nA0jk','chat',458,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_46qivtwmxdo","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"नमस्कार! 👋 Car Rent Pe मध्ये स्वागतं!nnआम्ही तुम्हाला सर्वोत्तम कार शोधायला मदत करू. बस एक लहान प्रश्न — तुम्हाला किती दिवस किराएवर कार हवी आहे? आणि किती लोक प्रवास करणार आहेत?nn(किंवा सर्व कार पाहायचं असेल तर सरळ सांगा! 😊)\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 13:42:54","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1632,'nA0jk','chat',461,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:10:43","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1633,'nA0jk','chat',462,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"95O9497566\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for sharing that number! 😊 Just to confirm — is that your mobile number? And may I have your name as well so our team can assist you better?nnIn the meantime, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and what dates are you looking at?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:11:11","_zc_chat_turns":"4"}'),
(1634,'nA0jk','chat',463,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_ndlbyz2omr","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you in today — a quick trip, weekend getaway, or something else? And roughly how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"95O9497566\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Thanks for sharing that number! 😊 Just to confirm — is that your mobile number? And may I have your name as well so our team can assist you better?nnIn the meantime, what kind of trip are you planning? How many people, and what dates are you looking at?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ha\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Ha! 😄 So, tell me — are you looking to rent a car for a trip? How many people will be traveling, and do you have dates in mind?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 15:11:52","_zc_chat_turns":"6"}'),
(1635,'nA0jk','chat',464,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_u0kri4vpjf","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"We don''t have a 7-seater in our current fleet. All our cars are 5-seaters. nnWould a 5-seater work for you, or are you looking for something specifically to fit a larger group? If you let me know how many people you''re planning to travel with and your budget, I can suggest the best option! 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 18:42:52","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1636,'nA0jk','chat',465,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_qy4n4cs23l","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hi\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey there! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe! I''m here to help you find and book the perfect car in Navi Mumbai.nnWhat brings you here today — are you looking for a car for a quick trip, a weekend getaway, or something else? And how many people will be traveling?\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 19:31:36","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1637,'nA0jk','chat',466,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_j816dglvga","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"We don''t have a 7-seater in our current fleet — all our cars are 5-seaters. nnFor a group of 7, you could book two cars, or if you''d like to explore what we have, I can help you pick the best option for your trip. How many people are you planning to travel with, and what dates did you have in mind? 🚗\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-11 20:02:31","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
(1638,'nA0jk','chat',467,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_7xf98gfobjy","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Do you have a 7-seater?\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Our current fleet at Navi Mumbai has 5-seater cars only — no 7-seaters available right now. nnWe have four great 5-seater options (Toyota Glanza, Maruti Suzuki Fronx in Manual or Automatic, and Maruti Suzuki Baleno). Would any of these work for your trip, or would you like me to check what else might suit your needs? 😊\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-13 05:09:27","_zc_chat_turns":"2"}'),
