(1651,'nA0jk','chat',635,'{"_zc_chat_session":"sess_47pqdbfzvei","_zc_chat_transcript":"[{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Show me available cars\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Hey! 👋 Welcome to Car Rent Pe. We have some great options in Navi Mumbai.nnQuick question — how many people are you planning to travel with, and roughly how many days do you need the car?nnThat way I can suggest the perfect fit for you!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"my name is nitin\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Nice to meet you, Nitin! 😊nnTo help you pick the right car, could you tell me:n- How many people will be traveling?n- How many days do you need the car for?nnOnce I know that, I''ll show you the best options!\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"thar i want\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Got it! So you''re looking for a car that can handle more people and longer trips. 👍nnLet me ask — how many passengers total, and for how many days? That''ll help me narrow down the perfect match for you from our fleet.\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"user\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"6 people and 3 days\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\"role\\\\\\":\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\",\\\\\\"content\\\\\\":\\\\\\"Perfect! For 6 people over 3 days, I''d recommend the Mahindra XUV500 — it''s a 7-seater SUV, great for families and groups.nnMahindra XUV500 - ₹4,488/day. Book: https://omkartest.carrentpe.com/cars/mahindra-xuv500/nnWhat are your pickup and return dates and times? Then I can show you the exact price for your 3 days.\\\\\\"}]","_zc_chat_updated":"2026-07-14 10:43:05","_zc_chat_turns":"8","_zc_chat_name":"Nitin"}'),
